<title>USA: DuPont Photomasks enters four-way pact.</title>
<headline>DuPont Photomasks enters four-way pact.</headline>
<dateline>ROUND ROCK, Texas 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>DuPont Photomasks Inc (DPI) said Wednesday it entered into a technology venture among DPI and three key semiconductor manufacturers.</p>
<p>They are Advanced Micro Devices Inc, Micron Technology Inc. and Motorola Inc.</p>
<p>The venture is for advanced photomask technology development and pilot line fabrication of leading-edge photomasks, a statement from DuPont Photomasks said.</p>
</text>
